b. increasing Women's Empowerment in various;
c. professions;
d. increasing the role and function of women in political organizations;
e. involving women to actively participate in development programs, providing access for women to participate in the Provincial Regional Government environment;
f. providing leadership opportunities for women;
g. fostering and developing forums or institutions for women in order to increase Women's Empowerment; and
