The objectives of Protection of women and children consist of:
a. preventing all forms of violence against women and children, providing Protection and services to women and children victims of violence;
b. providing a sense of security to women and children from crime and violence;
c. preventing children from child marriage, guaranteeing Protection and fulfillment of children's rights; and
d. providing reproductive health guarantees for women and children.

